msgid "By the end of this learning path, you'll be able to:"
msgstr "이 과정을 마치면 다음을 수행할 수 있습니다."

msgid "**Configure** and calibrate an SO-101 robot for sim-to-real experiments"
msgstr "**Configure**: sim-to-real 실험을 위한 SO-101 robot 설정과 calibration"

msgid ""
"**Collect** demonstration data using teleoperation or a scripted controller, with domain "
"randomization"
msgstr ""
"**Collect**: domain randomization을 적용한 teleoperation 또는 scripted controller 기반 demonstration data"
" 수집"

msgid "**Train** vision-language-action (VLA) models using GR00T for robot manipulation"
msgstr "**Train**: GR00T를 사용한 robot manipulation용 vision-language-action (VLA) model 학습"

msgid "**Evaluate** trained policies in simulation"
msgstr "**Evaluate**: 학습한 policy를 simulation에서 평가"

msgid "**Deploy** policies to physical robots and observe the sim-to-real gap"
msgstr "**Deploy**: 실제 robot에 policy를 배포하고 sim-to-real gap 관찰"

msgid ""
"**Explore** five sim-to-real strategies: Domain Randomization, Co-training, HG-DAgger, Cosmos "
"Augmentation, and System Identification with AnchorBench"
msgstr ""
"**Explore**: Domain Randomization, Co-training, HG-DAgger, Cosmos Augmentation, AnchorBench를 활용한 "
"System Identification의 다섯 가지 sim-to-real 전략 탐색"

msgid ""
"Welcome to this hands-on workshop! This content includes theory presentations, and the hands-on "
"instructions you need to complete this workshop."
msgstr "실습 중심의 workshop에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 이 자료에는 이론 설명과 workshop을 완료하는 데 필요한 실습 안내가 포함되어 있습니다."

